WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.820
Narrator: Ibrox Stadium, Glasgow, 1971.

2
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:11.790
Narrator: At the final whistle, thousands of fans went down one steep stairway, all in the same direction.

3
00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:14.410
Narrator: Near the bottom, people fell.

4
00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.680
Narrator: Those behind couldn't stop.

5
00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:22.230
Narrator: Sixty-six people died, many of them young.

6
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:29.800
Narrator: The lesson: stairs, a dense crowd and one fall can lead to a crowd collapse.

7
00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:36.820
Narrator: Try to avoid letting people queue on stairs especially if they are part of your means of escape.

8
00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:43.600
Narrator: If it can't be avoided, then you must have adequate control.

